From 9277a471f1dca981407ebf5d559998ff55cfe9db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 17:19:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 473/913] dts: stm32: remove unsupported field
 regulator-initial-mode

Simplify the STMP13/STM32MP15 by removing the unneeded field
regulator-initial-mode for STPMIC1 regulators, copied from Linux
kernel nodes but not supported in OP-TEE.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 5ad59d98f07416b6b4a21f5857c8eeb896b6f135 dts: stm32: remove unsupported field regulator-initial-mode]
